     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Would you like me to promote with the env soc community?</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hope you are all well.  </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">We are doing fine.  Lots of work to cancel Fate of the Earth and the Koch lecture and a trip to Midwest and Seattle.  Oh well.  Our daughter Alex, who runs half of path at UVM Medical Center d is a bit frayed but doing okay.  She of course cannot believe the lack of tests--cannot get one for herself or any of her staff/faculty.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Will try to get on the call on the research opp although I find I&#39;m busier than I thought I would be.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Best</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Tom</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
